@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：通行密鑰（Passkey/WebAuthn）註冊與登入

actor 使用者 as User
participant "PasskeysCard /\nPasskeySignInButton" as UI
participant "ApiService(PasskeysApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "POST /api/users/me/passkeys/options" as OptRoute
participant "POST /api/users/me/passkeys" as RegRoute
participant "POST /api/auth/passkeys/login" as LoginRoute
participant "services/passkeys.js" as PasskeySvc
participant "@simplewebauthn/server" as WebAuthn
database "user_passkeys /\nwebauthn_challenges" as DB

== 註冊（需登入 + sensitive 驗證）==
User -> UI : 點擊「新增通行密鑰」
UI -> UI : VerificationService.requireSensitive()
UI -> ApiSvc : passkeyRegistrationOptions()
ApiSvc -> OptRoute : POST .../passkeys/options
OptRoute -> PasskeySvc : registrationOptions(userId)
PasskeySvc -> PasskeySvc : 檢查已註冊數 < 10（否則400 PASSKEY_LIMIT）
PasskeySvc -> WebAuthn : generateRegistrationOptions()\n(residentKey=required, userVerification=required)
PasskeySvc -> DB : webauthn_challenges.insert(purpose='register')
PasskeySvc --> UI : 註冊選項(challenge, excludeCredentials)
UI -> UI : 系統喚起裝置建立金鑰(Face ID/指紋/螢幕鎖)
UI -> ApiSvc : registerPasskey(attestation, device_label)
ApiSvc -> RegRoute : POST /api/users/me/passkeys
RegRoute -> PasskeySvc : register(userId, attestation)
PasskeySvc -> DB : 消耗挑戰值(先刪除再檢查purpose/user/HMAC)
PasskeySvc -> WebAuthn : verifyRegistrationResponse()
alt 驗證失敗或憑證已存在
  PasskeySvc --> UI : 400/409 錯誤
else 成功
  PasskeySvc -> DB : user_passkeys.insert(credential_id, public_key,\nsign_count, aaguid, transports)
  PasskeySvc -> DB : notify「已新增通行密鑰」
  PasskeySvc --> UI : 201 最新清單
end

== 登入（探索式，公開端點）==
User -> UI : 點擊「使用通行密鑰登入」
UI -> ApiSvc : passkeyLoginOptions()（不帶email）
ApiSvc -> LoginRoute : POST /api/auth/passkeys/login/options
LoginRoute -> PasskeySvc : loginOptions()
PasskeySvc -> DB : webauthn_challenges.insert(purpose='login')
PasskeySvc --> UI : 挑戰值(由系統列出本機可用金鑰)
UI -> UI : 系統喚起生物辨識/螢幕鎖
UI -> ApiSvc : passkeyLogin(assertion)
ApiSvc -> LoginRoute : POST /api/auth/passkeys/login
LoginRoute -> PasskeySvc : login(assertion)
PasskeySvc -> DB : 消耗挑戰值 → 依credential_id查詢
PasskeySvc -> WebAuthn : verifyAuthenticationResponse()
alt 簽章計數倒退（sign_count未增加）
  PasskeySvc -> DB : 記錄安全事件 + 發送「通行密鑰驗證異常」通知
  PasskeySvc --> UI : 400 PASSKEY_COUNTER_REGRESSED
else 驗證成功
  PasskeySvc -> DB : 更新sign_count/backed_up/last_used_at
  PasskeySvc -> PasskeySvc : issueLogin(user, device, 'passkey')
  PasskeySvc --> UI : 200 { token, user }
end

note right of DB
  帳號列舉防護：登入選項帶email時，
  查無帳號一律回傳以該email HMAC
  推導的固定假憑證，回應結構與
  真實帳號一致，避免被用來探測
  帳號是否存在。
end note
@enduml
